  {
    "id": "d2d0a09f701af251185a",
    "source": "Open Game Master is a Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5e table where an AI sits in the Dungeon Master&apos;s chair, or a friend does with the AI as their assistant. You and your friends play the adventurers. The app is the rulebook and the dice.",
    "sourceHash": "d2d0a09f701af251185ab034deb5d34d465ad5ee989031eecf0fb02174b4d0c2",
    "kinds": [
